{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36805","headline":"病中上钱尚父 · 罗隐","name":"病中上钱尚父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左脚方行右臂挛，每慙名迹污宾筵。\n纵饶吴土容衰病，争奈燕台费料钱。\n藜杖已乾难更把，竹舆虽在不堪悬。\n深恩重德无言处，回首浮生泪泫然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}